  "text": "Jins Mukhalif Sharqi New A variation of Jins Sikah with a lowered 3 rd Jins Index Pronunciation of Mukhalif Sharqi Click the notes and hold using the mouse to hear them play. Jins Mukhalif Sharqi has no ghammaz , and therefore no defined size. It is notated here with its tonic on E . Jins Mukhalif Sharqi is not part of any maqam scale and usually occurs as a modulation from Jins Sikah . Dawr Emta el-Hawa (1936) Umm Kulthum Music by Zakariya Ahmad (Egypt) Ghannili Shwayy Shwayy (1945) Umm Kulthum Music by Zakariya Ahmad (Egypt) Raqsat al-Sus (1974) Music by the Rahbani Brothers From the operetta \"Lulu\" Dawr Lisan el-Dam‘i Yusuf al-Manyalawi Muwashah Ma-htiyali (khana) Aicha Redouane Arabesques Vocales © 2000 Muwashah Ya Samiri Da‘a Sabri Muhammad Khayri Tahmila Rast (Suznak) Aicha Redouane Arabesques Vocales © 2000 Ya ‘Ammi Ya Saheb el-Gamal Vocals and Music by Ahmed Adaweyah Taqsim Violin Abdu Daghir Al-Gibali el-Layli Ma Birda Bukra Vocals and Music by Wadih al-Safi Ib‘id ‘Anni ‘Uyunak Yasmin al-Khayyam Music by Muhammad Abdel Wahab (Egypt) Ib‘id ‘Anni ‘Uyunak - Nay Solo Yasmin al-Khayyam Music by Muhammad Abdel Wahab (Egypt)",
